        ],
        "summary": "Stream Agent",
        "description": "SSE run: subscribe before the run starts, then frame every event.\nResume with `Last-Event-ID` (durable cursor) plus `run_id` in the body;\na finished run replays from the DB, a live one from its sink. The stream\nends with the run's single terminal event.",
